the -ceph- of -cephalous, but the -alof -cephalic.
===
the -ceph- of *-cephalous*, but the -al- of *-cephalic*.
>>>

<<<
however, & -ic is the commoner, -cephalous should be abandoned as a NEEDLESS VARIANT.
===
however, & *-ic* is the commoner, *-cephalous* should be abandoned as a ^^NEEDLESS VARIANT^^.
