>>>

<<<
Cesarevitch or -witch, Cesarevna, are the right forms for the Czar’s eldest son & that son’s wife. Pronounce siz&’riwich. Czarevitch is an obsolete title superseded by Grand Duke.
===
**Cesarevitch or -witch, Cesarevna,** are the right forms for the Czar's eldest son & that son's wife. Pronounce sĭză'rĭwĭch. *Czarevitch* is an obsolete title superseded by *Grand Duke*.
>>>

